{\b\fs22 DarkCipher ServerManagement}\par
Open-source software under the MIT License. Copyright \'a9 2026 darkcipher0x.\par
\par
Manages Vultr cloud resources and Linux servers over SSH from this PC. Everything it stores (hosts, passwords, SSH keys, API keys, settings, audit log) is encrypted on this PC with AES-256-GCM. No account, no cloud service of its own, no telemetry: it only talks to the servers, the Vultr API and the Ollama instance you configure.\par
